  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium high heat.",
    "Cut the Chinese leaf into large pieces and set aside.",
    "In a blender, combine olive oil, garlic, and ginger to make a marinade.",
    "Cut the chicken breast into bite sized pieces and add to the marinade.",
    "Cut the bell peppers and onions into large pieces.",
    "Alternate threading the chicken, Chinese leaf, bell peppers, and onions onto skewers.",
    "Brush the skewers with soy sauce.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
